# Contact form delivery
#
# The contact form posts the message to a form service, so the visitor never
# leaves the page and never needs an email client. Pick one of the two options
# below and put it in `.env` (copy this file), then restart the dev server.
#
# Option 1 (recommended): Web3Forms
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter thanishka.ykb@gmail.com
#   2. The access key arrives by email instantly, no account needed
#   3. Paste it below and restart
#
# This key is publishable: it only routes submissions to that inbox. It is not
# a password. Optional: restrict it to your domain in the Web3Forms dashboard.
#
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-access-key-here
#
# Option 2: any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST of
# { name, email, subject, message } and answers 2xx (Formspree, Basin, a
# Cloudflare Worker, etc.). This takes priority over the key above.
#
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://your-endpoint.example.com/your-form-id
